{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20264Nc9iwJbSz1792708173.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>油價上升引發通脹憂慮，金價跌至兩星期低位。</p><p></p><p>紐約期金收市報4,060.4美元一盎司，跌89.6美元，跌幅百分之2.1。現貨金價最低見4,021.32美元，跌119.42美元，跌幅近百分之2.9。</p><p></p><p>澳新銀行分析員庫瑪麗認為金價可能進一步下跌，因為能源市場仍然存在大量的不確定性。國際油價剛升至超過五個月高位，再一次升穿110美元一桶。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T23:40:03.890473+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T22:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T23:18:10.723686+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T23:37:55.021485+00:00","content_hash":"b8fe22d5a1f9bb7e81d859aba6e2c383287766ff77816ebf6117661a2b133ee7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T23:40:03.890473+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}